# AURA frontend configuration lives in .env.local - see .env.local.example.
#
# This file previously carried GEMINI_API_KEY and APP_URL from the AI Studio
# scaffold. Both were removed: the frontend never calls an AI provider directly,
# and an AI key in a VITE_ variable is an AI key published to every visitor
# (AURA-BE/docs/SECURITY.md, section 1). AI calls happen on the server.
